# Harta: Bind — Spike Rush (Attacker side)
# Bind are teleporters — eventuri speciale

MAPBG data/images/bind.png
START spawn

NODE spawn start "Bind attacker spawn. No mid on this map — it's A or B, plus the teleporters. Where do you commit?"
CHOICE spawn a "Push A through showers" a_showers
CHOICE spawn b "Push B through hookah" b_hookah
CHOICE spawn t "Use the B-to-A teleporter mid-round" teleport ROTATE

NODE a_showers start "A showers approach. Tight corridor — info says a Raze lurks inside with a satchel ready."
CHOICE a_showers f "Flash into showers and push" a_flash
CHOICE a_showers b "Boost someone over the wall" a_boost
CHOICE a_showers r "Rotate B — showers is too risky" b_hookah TEAM_IGNORED

NODE a_flash start "Your Breach flashes showers perfectly. Raze is blinded. Team pushes through uncontested."
CHOICE a_flash p "Straight rush to A default — plant fast" a_plant
CHOICE a_flash s "Smoke off CT and set up slower" a_setup

NODE a_plant win "Fast plant under flash cover. Defenders can't get back in time through showers. Round won."
TERMINAL a_plant win

NODE a_setup win "Controlled site take. Smokes cut off the CT angle. Clean plant. Defenders can't defuse safely."
TERMINAL a_setup win

NODE a_boost spike_dropped "You boost someone over the wall — but the spike carrier falls and DROPS IT on the other side."
CHOICE a_boost g "Jump back over and grab it" a_plant SPIKE_DROPPED
CHOICE a_boost l "Leave it and try to plant another one" a_flash

NODE b_hookah start "B hookah approach. Enemy has a one-way smoke set on hookah. You can't see through it."
CHOICE b_hookah t "Throw a grenade in to clear the smoke" b_clear
CHOICE b_hookah p "Peek aggressively through the one-way" b_peek TEAM_IGNORED
CHOICE b_hookah r "Use teleporter — rotate to A" teleport ROTATE

NODE b_clear start "Nade into hookah. The defender is forced out. Your team rushes in cleanly."
CHOICE b_clear p "Plant on B default" b_plant
CHOICE b_clear c "Plant on B corner position" b_plant

NODE b_plant win "Clean B execute. Spike planted, enemies forced to push into your crossfire. Round won."
TERMINAL b_plant win

NODE b_peek team_ignored "Your teammates don't follow the peek. You're alone on site. 2v1 retake destroys you."
TERMINAL b_peek lose

NODE teleport rotate "You send one player through the B-to-A teleporter. The loud sound is heard — defenders rotate immediately!"
CHOICE teleport a "Execute A before the rotation arrives" a_flash
CHOICE teleport b "Fake teleport — actually go B" b_clear
CHOICE teleport w "Wait in teleporter, let team push A" a_plant
